    <title>
        <en>AgForward Financial Cooperative</en>
    </title>

    <description>
        <en><![CDATA[
AgForward is an agriculture-focused financial system for Farming Simulator 25.

Current development focuses on the shared financial core: persistent ledger, purpose-aware accounting, credit products, asset finance, land finance and leasing, settlement, reporting, multiplayer authority, and optional Red Tape integration.
        ]]></en>
    </description>

    <multiplayer supported="true"/>

